📌 Summary of Key Findings
10,841 records with 15 variables analyzed.
14.2% missing cells and 3.8% duplicate rows identified.
Multiple high-cardinality features such as app name, size, and genres.
Strong correlations between Type and Price.
Imbalanced distributions in fields like Content Rating and Price.
